# Browser-verification leftovers. `playwright-report/` and `test-results/`
# above cover the test *runner*; these are what the MCP browser tools drop
# into whatever directory they are driven from — console logs, page
# snapshots, and ad-hoc screenshots. Every agent that walks a flow in a
# browser dirtied its worktree with these until they were listed here.
# The `/` anchors the screenshot rule to the repo root, so the committed
# apps/web/src/app/opengraph-image.png is untouched.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
.auth/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills
!.claude/hooks
!.claude/agents
!.claude/commands
!.claude/protocol
.vercel/
.worktrees/

